            "sid": "JDG 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji wandu wa muzi werewukieghe nakesho wikawona madhabahu ya Baali imerie kuchikanywa chiaimweri na ghuja mlungu ghwa waka Ashera ghorekoghe na mbai ya iyo madhabahu, na wokoni ija njau ya kawi imerie kufunywa kizongona aighu ya iyo madhabahu ereaghiloghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikakotiana weni na weni, “Nani ubonyere ilagho iji?” Hata nyuma ya kukotia maza iro, wikamanya na kughamba, “Gideoni mwana wa Joashi nuo ubonyere ilagho ijo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa muzi wikamzera Joashi, “Funya mwana wako upate kubwaghwa, angu wamerie kuichikanya madhabahu ya Baali na kuinja Ashera uja orekoghe na mbai yaro.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Joashi ukawizera awo wandu wose werekoghe wikisimana nao, “Wele muasimana aighu ya Baali? Angu muamdederia? Uo ose umdederiagha uchabwaghwa kesho. Ikakaia uo ni mlungu, ndekudederie moni angu madhabahu yake yachikanywa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo ituku ijo Gideoni ukawangwa Jerubaali; na kutambua kwaro ni “Baali ndekudederie moni,” angu oreichikanyireghe madhabahu yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
