          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Gideoni ukamzera Mlungu, “Ikakaia oho kuchawikira Waisraeli kwa mkonu ghwapo sa iji kughorie, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ola ini niawika mafuri gha ng'ondi wazenyi echania ngano; kukareda mami aighu ya agho mafuri ghiekeri na ndoe yose isigharikie iomie, niko nichaamanya angu oho kuchawikira Israeli sa iji koni kughorie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ikakaia woruwo; ukawuka nakesho kio, ukakama agho mafuri ukachura bakuli imweri ya machi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Gideoni ukamzera Mlungu, “Kusakebonya machu aighu yapo, leka nighore indo jimweri. Nakulomba kunisighe nitime agha mafuri indo jimu. Idana mafuri ndeghisigharike ghiomie, na ndoe ikaie na mami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Mlungu ukabonya woruwo kio chija; nakesho mafuri ghikakaia ghiomie na ndoe ikachua mami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.40"
            ]
